  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Wake up every morning and have a cup of coffee on the deck looking out at the Gulf. You may even get a dolphin show. It doesn't get much better than that. Then walk down to the sugar white sand, swim in the beautiful crystal blue water. When you are thirsty, hungry or just need a nap, you are steps away from the house. This unit has been completely remodeled, new kitchen (Quartz countertops with quality stainless appliances), master bathroom (frameless walk-in shower), Bedding (Westin Heavenly Beds), furniture (Pottery Barn Sectional and recliner), recessed lighting, and 3 TV's (featuring 65\" 4K TV). The deck has quality Polywood furniture with Sunbrella cushions (two lounge chairs, four bar height chairs and large 48\" table for Al Fresco dining). Our townhouse is truly a home away from home. Our unit has a fully stocked kitchen with a large pantry, should you choose to cook. But if you want to enjoy eating out, there are many restaurants to choose from on 30A. Every type of food you could want from Sushi to Pizza, 30A has it all. <br><br>The master has a King size bed with Westin \"Heavenly Bed\" Mattress, with a private balcony, full bath with frameless walk in shower. Second bedroom has a Queen Bed with Westin \"Heavenly Bed\" Mattress and built in bunk beds with a full En-suite bathroom. Our living area has a Pottery Barn sofa Sectional with Wrapped Down cushions seat and a leather recliner. 65 inch LCD smart TV 4K, with HD box, & 100Mbps+ Wi-Fi. All bedrooms have TVs. There is also a half bath on the main level. We have covered parking below. We also offer full sized top loaded washer and dryer with stainless tubs.<br><br>Our townhome is situated between Seaside and Alys Beach in Sea Grove beach near Eastern Lake. We are just a short drive to Destin, Panama City Beach, Rosemary Beach & Grayton Beach. They all offer wonderful restaurants, nightlife and much more.<br><br>Come, Relax and Enjoy!!!<br><br><br>Keywords: Townhome",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Gulf-front 30A Townhome - Steps to the Beach."
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
